cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below and credit MERA Robotics, merarobotics.com (CC BY 4.0)."
type: dataset
title: "Humanoid Robots Database"
abstract: "Open dataset of humanoid robot models from manufacturers worldwide: manufacturer, country, height, mass, payload, degrees of freedom, speed, runtime, launch year, status, source of the specification and links to the model pages in up to 54 languages. No prices. A description of the market, not MERA stock."
authors:
  - name: "MERA Robotics"
    website: "https://merarobotics.com"
    country: PL
    city: Warszawa
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://merarobotics.com/en/data/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ma1orek/humanoid-robots-database"
keywords:
  - humanoid robots
  - robotics
  - robot specifications
  - open data
  - degrees of freedom
